React Counter & Form App

Project Description

This is a simple React application that demonstrates the use of state management and event handling. It includes a counter and a basic form.

Features

Counter with increase and decrease buttons
Form handling with input fields (email and password)


Installation Instructions

Install Node.js
Create React app using vite:

   npm create vite@latest my-app
Run the app:

   npm start

Usage

Click buttons to increase or decrease counter
Enter email and password in the form
Click submit to submit data
